/*
  ===========================================================================
  RULES OF THE ROAD — PRACTICE QUESTIONS  (ADI Stage 1)

  Built from the 153 Rules of the Road flashcards in this project. Road law is
  examined on ADI Stage 1 alongside the instructor-specific material, so these
  sit inside the ADI Theory section, not under the learner-driver path.
  Each card becomes a multiple-choice question: the card's question is the
  stem, its answer is the correct option, and the three wrong options are real
  answers taken from other cards — preferring ones from the same narrow topic
  with the same kind of answer, so a question about a distance offers other
  distances rather than a paragraph about fatigue.

  READ THIS BEFORE YOU CHARGE ANYONE FOR IT
  The wrong options are chosen automatically, not written by hand. Most read
  well, but some will be weak, and occasionally a distractor might be true in
  some other context even though it doesn't answer the question asked. Go
  through them once and fix anything that reads badly. This is a strong
  practice set, not a replacement for the official RSA question bank.

  Editing by hand is fine and expected — nothing regenerates this file
  automatically.
  ===========================================================================
*/

